@startuml
title L2-044 - Adapt every workflow to viewport size
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #667085
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}

actor "Owner / release reviewer" as actor
box "Frontend - Loupe application" #E0F2FE
participant "LibraryShell" as page
participant "LayoutProfile" as entity
end box
box "Frontend - Loupe components / api contracts" #E0F2FE
participant "View / interface-bound service or test harness" as client
end box
note over page, client : Local interaction; feature services use their documented API slices
actor -> page : Start workflow / review
page -> entity : Select exact grid/detail/comparison breakpoint [L2-044]
entity --> page : Columns and stacking for current width
page -> client : Open compact navigation or scrollable dialog
client --> page : All controls reachable; background inert; focus visible
page --> actor : full-frame image and reachable controls
@enduml
